{"about_the_game":"<strong>The Suits Have Gone Mad! is a brand new episodic horror brought to you by Blank Dream Studios. Unravel the mysteries behind the monopoly of Blake &amp; Whitley Innovations and bring color into a dull world.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/cd77b873d0adb0eab52d4eee4c7124be.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Learn about the daily life of an employee at Blake &amp; Whitley. Everything will be okay as long as you work hard and stay out of trouble...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/0b4fde5293b3e8ed9a23616a2afcf384.poster.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/0b4fde5293b3e8ed9a23616a2afcf384.webm?t=1727573087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/0b4fde5293b3e8ed9a23616a2afcf384.mp4?t=1727573087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/b606f7bb08dbfb2106931f951218d5ee.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>A business behemoth in the world, dominating the market in tone production and distribution. Employees are pushed to the limits with little reward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/2128dc5e6d5f2a589dd191759c2b7b94.poster.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/2128dc5e6d5f2a589dd191759c2b7b94.webm?t=1727573087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/2128dc5e6d5f2a589dd191759c2b7b94.mp4?t=1727573087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/822c8dc0f95f82c2e8e3026948d96ba4.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Theo Blue, an ordinary senior innovator at the company unexpectedly discovers color while working on a typical day. Executives witness this discovery and mysteriously demand for his apprehension.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/fc13aa70246b77f858d2a148be07096a.poster.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/fc13aa70246b77f858d2a148be07096a.webm?t=1727573087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/fc13aa70246b77f858d2a148be07096a.mp4?t=1727573087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/14128821448f57bc0e1494142ddc3d33.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Business suits search floor to floor, persistent in your capture. Avoid them in any way possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/18f655d781c4e054345a3e0da174e756.poster.avif?t=1727573087\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110540/extras/18f655d78